==Enemy==
Zir Zeal has the typical burrowing and respawning abilities of a Zombie enemy. However, when Zir Zeal burrows, he takes his sweet, sweet time to dig a huge 1500-length tunnel underground, exceeding the standing range of any cat and breaking a few tunneling laws in the process, because he can. Consequentially, Zir Zeal tends to overshoot the blind spots of [[:Category:Long Distance Cats|Long Distance Cats]] and will actually not pose an immediate threat to your backline. Of course, this also means that he may dig past any attackers that could immediately deal with him, so it's advised that you save the [[Cat Cannon]] to cancel his burrow or force him to the surface with a [[Ototo Corps#Holy Blast|Holy Blast]], failing to do so will have the potential to create a wall between your meatshields and the frontlines, especially if you don't have the proper units off cooldown to deal with him.

Alternatively, he might dig directly to your base and start ripping chunks off it. Depending on how much health you already have, this could be the difference between winning or losing.

==Strategy==
Killing Zir Zeal quickly is recommended so he doesn't leave a gaping hole in your defense, especially if he gets to the Cat Base. If there aren't any more threatening [[:Category:Enemies with Burrow ability|burrowers]] like [[Dread Bore]], you can use Holy Blast to force him to burrow up, and the freeze can give your attackers time to beat him. Speaking of attackers, in early stages a stack of [[Wushu Cat (Rare Cat)|Wushu Cats]] can fend him off, while also being your best meatshield. Past that, you should use basically any [[:Category:Zombie Killer Cats|unit with Zombie Killer]], as he takes his sweet time reviving and can catch your midrangers and backliners off-guard. Beware that [[Li'l Bird Cat (Special Cat)|Li'l Flying Cat]] doesn't outrange Zir Zeal, so you'll want to use [[Teacher BearCat (Rare Cat)|Cadaver BearCat]] or [[Ancient Egg: N107 (Rare Cat)|Cat Chief]]. Any [[:Category:Anti-Zombie Cats|Anti-Zombie]] [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Ubers]] can also wipe him off the face of the earth.

